mangday kamo do araraw a somaray a yamacikaop ji yeso so papirwan ko pa sya ipanci jinyo an somaray kamo an
no kanang am amyan do ili da so asa ka mavakes a meyraraten mamizing na si yeso amyan do vahay da no tao a macyagom do vadisay am mangai so asa ka tagaw a mahangno a ipeykeykoris
yamen rana do yamakakaday a vazay am yanamen akmey tongbowa o yameykamadadayan a alalaw do namen kanoyong a lamlamsoy ni ama ta do to
